{"ref":"BDB, קַנָּא","hw":"קַנָּא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַנָּא</span></big>  <strong>adj. jealous</strong>;—only of God: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל קַנָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:5\" href=\"/Exodus.20.5\">Ex 20:5</a> (E) = <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.9\">Dt 5:9</a> (as punishing those who hate him), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:14\" href=\"/Exodus.34.14\">Ex 34:14</a> (J); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.24\">Dt 4:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.15\">6:15</a> (demanding exclusive service); <span dir=\"rtl\">קַנָּא שְׁמוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:14\" href=\"/Exodus.34.14\">Ex 34:14</a> (J).","next":"BDB, קַנּוֹא","prev":"BDB, קָנָא"}